<title>GREECE: GREEK CIVIL AVIATION 24-HOUR STRIKE SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>GREEK CIVIL AVIATION 24-HOUR STRIKE SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federation of Civil Aviation Associations (OSYPA) has suspended its December 20-21 strike after being reassured by transport minister Haralambos Kastanidis that salaries and bonuses will remain the same, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
